OL,3,AGlastonbury confirms ticket sale dates
OL,4,A- and highest ever price
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter taking a fallow year in 2026, the
OL,7,FGlastonbury Festival has confirmed that
OL,8,Ftickets for next year's event will go
OL,9,Fon sale in October.
OL,11,FTickets for the weekend will cost #408
OL,12,Fincluding a #5 booking fee per ticket -
OL,13,Fan increase of #29.50 from 2025.
OL,15,FHeadliners for the festival, which
OL,16,Ftakes place from 23 to 27 June, have
OL,17,Fyet to be announced, but rumours are
OL,18,Falready swirling, with everyone from
OL,19,FHarry Styles and Fontaines DC to Taylor
OL,20,FSwift and Stevie Wonder said to be in
OL,21,Fthe mix.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
